msgstr "Nastavené vo wp-config.php."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:251
msgid ""
"Create the API key in Denár under Account -> API keys with the scopes "
"documents and partners (read and write)."
msgstr ""
"API kľúč vytvorte v Denári v Účet -> API kľúče s oprávneniami doklady a "
"partneri (čítanie aj zápis)."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:255
msgid "API URL"
msgstr "Adresa API"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:259
msgid ""
"Leave empty for the production Denár. Change only for staging or local "
"development."
msgstr ""
"Pre ostrý Denár nechajte prázdne. Meňte len pre staging alebo lokálny vývoj."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:264
msgid "API key"
msgstr "API kľúč"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:280
msgid "Webhook"
msgstr "Webhook"

#. translators: %s: webhook URL
#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:283
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In Denár under Account -> Webhooks add the URL %s with the events "
"document.paid and document.cancelled, then paste its secret here."
msgstr ""
"V Denári v Účet -> Webhooky pridajte adresu %s s udalosťami document.paid a "
"document.cancelled a jej tajný kľúč vložte sem."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:289
msgid "Webhook secret"
msgstr "Tajný kľúč webhooku"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:305
msgid "Documents"
msgstr "Doklady"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:306
msgid ""
"Card and gateway payments get an invoice right away, other orders at the "
"statuses chosen below (cash on delivery when the order is completed), "
"refunds a credit note. A document whose total in Denár differs from the "
"order stays a draft for you to check."
msgstr ""
"Platba kartou alebo bránou dostane faktúru hneď, ostatné objednávky pri "
"stavoch vybraných nižšie (dobierka pri vybavení), vrátenie peňazí dobropis. "
"Doklad, ktorého suma v Denári nesedí s objednávkou, ostane konceptom na "
"kontrolu."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:310
msgid "Send orders to Denár"
msgstr "Odosielať objednávky do Denára"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:311
msgid "Issue documents for orders automatically"
msgstr "Automaticky vystavovať doklady k objednávkam"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:317
msgid "Bank transfer"
msgstr "Bankový prevod"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:318
msgid ""
"Issue a proforma with PAY by square when the order is placed; the invoice "
"follows once Denár pairs the payment"
msgstr ""
"Pri objednávke vystaviť zálohovú faktúru s PAY by square; faktúra nasleduje, "
"keď Denár spáruje úhradu"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:324
msgid "Invoice at statuses"
msgstr "Faktúra pri stavoch"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:325
msgid ""
"The first of these statuses issues the invoice, marked paid. Add your own "
"statuses that mean the order is paid."
msgstr ""
"Prvý z týchto stavov vystaví faktúru ako uhradenú. Pridajte aj vlastné "
"stavy, ktoré znamenajú, že objednávka je zaplatená."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:330
msgid ""
"Card and gateway payments get the invoice as soon as they are paid, whatever "
"the status."
msgstr ""
"Platba kartou alebo bránou dostane faktúru hneď po zaplatení, bez ohľadu na "
"stav."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:334
msgid "Cash on delivery: invoice at statuses"
msgstr "Dobierka: faktúra pri stavoch"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:335
msgid "Cash on delivery is paid when the parcel is delivered."
msgstr "Dobierka je zaplatená až pri doručení zásielky."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:343
msgid "Invoice in e-mails"
msgstr "Faktúra v e-mailoch"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:344
msgid ""
"The invoice PDF from Denár goes with these customer e-mails (and always with "
"the invoice sent from the order screen). Turn off the invoice of a PDF "
"invoice plugin, or the customer gets two invoices."
msgstr ""
"PDF faktúry z Denára sa priloží k týmto e-mailom zákazníkovi (a vždy k "
"faktúre odoslanej z objednávky). Vo vašom plugine na PDF faktúry faktúru "
"vypnite, inak zákazník dostane dve faktúry."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:352
msgid "Number series"
msgstr "Číselný rad"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:355
msgid "default"
msgstr "predvolený"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:356
msgid ""
"Code of a number series from Denár -> Company -> Number series. Empty = the "
"series set on the API key, or the default one."
msgstr ""
"Kód číselného radu z Denár -> Firma -> Číselné rady. Prázdne = rad nastavený "
"pri API kľúči, inak predvolený."

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:360
msgid "EU reverse charge"
msgstr "Prenesenie daňovej povinnosti v EÚ"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:364
msgid "Goods to another EU member state"
msgstr "Tovar do iného členského štátu EÚ"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:365
msgid "Services to another EU member state"
msgstr "Služby do iného členského štátu EÚ"

#: src/Admin/SettingsPage.php:367
msgid ""
"Used when the order was placed without VAT because of a verified EU VAT id."
msgstr "Použije sa, keď bola objednávka bez DPH pre overené IČ DPH z EÚ."

#: src/Api/Client.php:127
msgid "The Denár API key is not set."
msgstr "API kľúč Denára nie je nastavený."

